      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "In June 2026, the Board of Directors reapproved the $18 billion share repurchase program to continue without a fixed expiration date and without increasing the aggregate amount authorized for repurchase.",
      "char_start": 39699,
      "char_end": 39902,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40021,
          40224
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 354,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "7ffc84c8-bee3-5806-8fdf-1b05a823efa7"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "As of August 31, 2026, we repurchased 124.4 million shares at an average price of $97.57 per share for a total approximate cost of $12.1 billion under the program.",
      "char_start": 39903,
      "char_end": 40066,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40225,
          40388
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 354,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "eb94f533-dec7-5348-91fc-a0187214a958"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We paused repurchases under this program during the first quarter of fiscal 2026 and no shares were repurchased during the quarter ended August 31, 2026.",
      "char_start": 40067,
      "char_end": 40220,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40389,
          40542
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 354,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "34e77813-cd17-5e76-b054-c5c0fbe9f9ff"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We may resume share repurchases in the future at any time, depending upon market conditions, operating cash flows and our liquidity and capital needs.",
      "char_start": 40221,
      "char_end": 40371,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40543,
          40693
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 354,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "bbeb0e5b-1038-55d1-b2bb-dfcc3112a257"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "FINANCING ACTIVITIES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We continue to expect funding of any future share repurchases to come from operating cash flows.",
      "char_start": 40372,
      "char_end": 40468,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40694,
          40790
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 354,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "3a167e2c-dda6-5c04-80e2-a21ab945f7eb"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "On July 17, 2025, we filed a shelf registration statement (the \"Shelf\") with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the \"SEC\") which permits us to issue an unlimited amount of securities from time to time.",
      "char_start": 40489,
      "char_end": 40700,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          40834,
          41045
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 356,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "53aa8e89-d013-4040-ad3a-4892206b66ec",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[125]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260831.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "80583ee6-b0d5-523a-823e-941937afb010"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000193",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "9fa9520e-eb59-46d9-93a5-d061b49efdee",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The Shelf expires on July 17, 2028.",
      "char_start": 40701,
      "char_end": 40736,
      "raw_spans": [
